<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλιγγ-ιάω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>become dizzy, lose one's head</i>, as when one looks
			down from a height, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλιγγιῶν ἀφ᾽ ὑψηλοῦ κρεμασθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					175d
				</span></i>
			; from drunkenness, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ ἰ. ὥσπερ μεθύουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					79c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. κάρα λίθῳ πεπληγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1218
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. καὶ χασμᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.176S.
				</span></i>
			; from perplexity, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκοτώθην καὶ ἰλιγγίασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					339e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. ὑπὸ τῆς τοῦ λόγου ἀπορίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					216c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ δέους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					581
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tox.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν θέαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.6
				</span></i>
			:—also written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλιγγιάω</span>, freq. in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.706
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Diog.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				74
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλιγγιάω</span> but
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴλιγγος</span> acc. to Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				581
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλιγγιῶ</span>
			.</div>
